{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Will they not know</b> — He expresses wonder, i.e., will these workers of iniquity not know, while they ate My people as though they ate bread, and did not say that HaShem gave them strength — in the manner of: our hand is raised high; and this is: they did not call upon YHWH."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:16.228754140Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}